\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs36\lang9 Dragon Quest XI S 2D - Party Chat\par
\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl\cf1\b0\f1\fs22 Rab\cell Aye, this is a nice wee village, right enough, with plenty of greenery everywhere ye look. It seems like a perfect spot to get away from it all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Mind you, at my age all the climbing would be hard work\emdash unless I could find someone to carry me, of course!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell One of the tockles informed me that this village is home to a warrior known as <LM_6>the reaper<LM_9> on account of his facility with a scythe.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I would very much like to meet this man, that I may learn more.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell From the first second we set foot in this place, everyone's been staring at me. At least now we know why.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell But if there really is some guy who looks just like me, I want to meet him. Right now, it seems he's out of town, so I guess we won't find out who's better looking anytime soon.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Alltrades Abbey's got so many nooks and crannies, it'd be the perfect place for a thief to hide out. It wouldn't be bad for a game of hide-and-seek either...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell But what if I lost my memory again, and forgot who I was looking for? Or what I was even doing? Yep, let's forget I ever brought it up...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell So it seems this is a place where priests can come to be turned into sages. It would be nice if we had a place like this back in Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell The sheer scale of this place sends a shiver down my spine. It's clearly somewhere very special.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell So this is where people come when they want to change careers, huh?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell You know honey, that's something that's never crossed my mind. Being an entertainer's all I've ever wanted, and now that I'm living the dream, I never want it to end!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I've heard that people can come here and choose to embark on new lives as martial artists.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I'm mostly self-taught when it comes to combat, so I'm not sure it's something I could ever do. But who knows, it might be interesting to take formal lessons and make it a full-time career.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell According to our wee pals the tockles, folks come here when they fancy a change of career.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Hm, maybe I could become a bunny girl? Aye, that wouldnae be so bad\emdash it might give me a new lease of life!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It seems that this is a place where those who wish to take a different path in life gather.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It is hard for me to imagine ever desiring such a thing. Indeed, it is hard for me to imagine being anything other than a knight.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell There are holy places like this all over Erdrea too, and I've got to say, I don't like them much. They're just kind of stuffy, you know?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell These Roamers know how to live\emdash wherever they pitch their tent is home. Yeah, I've always liked life on the road. The only thing that worries me is getting eaten by a monster in my sleep...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Imagine living in a tent, <pc>! It'd be like going on a camping trip every single day. I think it'd be a lot of fun\emdash as long as I didn't have to share.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell So that curious instrument that everyone's holding is called a torban, isn't it? I wonder what it sounds like!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell One look at the way these people move, honey, and you can tell right away that dancing's in their blood.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I wonder if they'll let me take to the stage with them sometime? The Wandering Wonder meets the Rocking Roamers\emdash it could be the show of the century!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Always on the move, without a place to call your own... The way the Roamers live reminds me of the time I spent travelling around with Rab.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Except I did have a place to call my own, of course\emdash Heliodor. I'd be lying if I said I didn't miss it a lot, but that time on the road made me who I am today.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell One of our tockle pals told me to try a wee dram of something called the Spirit of the Dance while I was here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It's an ancient Roamer brew, apparently, and imbued with all sorts of holiness. Let me know if ye catch a whiff of any going spare, won't ye, laddie?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh302\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell The Roamers are fine dancers, there is no doubt of that. As one who has no aptitude for such things, I can only admire their prowess.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Wandering round with your pals, pitching up for the night wherever you feel like it\emdash yep, these Roamers know what they're doing.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell The tockles mentioned something about people giving weird names to great sabrecats\emdash things like Leo, Mohicat, Purrcy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I mean, seriously\emdash who comes up with this stuff?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I've heard a rumour that in this world it's possible to ride around on the backs of sabrecats, like they were horses or something!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I wish I could do that back home. Then I might be able to keep up with you lot when you go racing off, leaving me and my little legs behind...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell A sabrecat who loves humans\emdash isn't that adorable? I wonder if we could be friends\emdash I mean, I don't speak sabrecat. But I could try...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell <LM_6>Meow are you?<LM_9> <LM_6>Purretty good, thanks!<LM_9><LM_LF>\par
Tee hee! I think I might be a natural!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I've tamed my share of lions during my time with the circus, but great sabrecats are uncharted territory for me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell The crowd would go wild if I could persuade one to perform with us, though. Oh honey, imagine if I made my entrance astride one of those magnificent beasts!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Did I ever tell you about the time I had to fight off four sabrecats singlehandedly as part of my training?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I knew I didn't have a hope of beating them for speed or agility, so I held back and waited till they got tired before whacking them on the nose, one after the other!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell So it turns out that even monsters have feelings, laddie. Treat them with a bit of respect and, who knows, ye might find ye have more in common than ye think.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell ...Of course, most of them are still going to be nasty wee so-and-sos. Ye wouldnae want to get too friendly with them.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Ah-ah-aaah-CHOO!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I must apologise for my constant bouts of sneezing ever since we got here.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell The tockles mentioned something about people giving weird names to great sabrecats\emdash things like Leo, Mohicat, Purrcy...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Pretty crazy names, right? I don't know who came up with them, but I kind of like them...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell So this is where the angels live, huh? Hm, I'm still kind of young to be in heaven...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Look, <pc>! We're above the clouds!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Come on, reach out and grab one! I'd do it myself, but my arms aren't long enough.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I can sense a curious power emanating from the tree in the middle of the observatory. It reminds me a little of Yggdrasil...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I wonder why anyone would want to live all the way up here in the clouds. Perhaps it's so they can look down on everything that's going on below\emdash you can't deny that the view's great.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Ugggh... (gulp)\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell I, I'll be alright in a minute, I promise. I just...struggle a little with heights, that's all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell It seems that this is the world of the angels, laddie. That's what our wee tockle pals told us, anyhow.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I've got to tell ye, I never thought I'd get the chance to see an angel in the flesh. Life's never dull, is it, laddie? Ye never know what's round the next corner.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell It would appear that the people of this world worship a great tree just as we do in Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell So this is where the angels live, huh? We've been to some pretty cool places, <pc>, but heaven? That's something else...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Do you think we could stop to grab a bite here, <pc>? I'm starving...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Listen to this, <pc>! This inn has special rooms called Royal Suites! You don't even have to be a king or queen to stay there, either!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell I don't suppose I could stay there for one night, could I...? Oh, come on! I promise I won't order room service or anything...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell The tockles told me that this place is home to a former winner of something called the Inncredible Inntertainer Award.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Apparently, it's awarded by an organisation called the Sinndicate. It sounds like there's more to innkeeping than meets the eye!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I hear that the owner of this inn is a young woman who's barely older than our darling <pc>!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Just imagine running a place like this at her age! She must be a pretty smart cookie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell You know, being in this inn reminds me of something that used to happen a lot when I was travelling around with Rab.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Whenever we'd stay anywhere, we'd somehow always end up in their very best suite, no matter how full the place was or how late we turned up.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell This looks like my kind of place, laddie! I'm hoping there's a well-stocked bar and many a bonnie lassie drinking at it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell This establishment would appear to serve many purposes. It is at once an inn and a tavern, a bank and a shop...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell From what I can gather, it is some kind of guild where like-minded adventurers can join forces and set out on quests together.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell A tavern! Nice! Let's take a quick break\emdash all work and no play makes you a dull boy, you know!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell Whoa! That is one seriously big palm tree. I don't suppose there are any coconuts lying around, are there? I'm starving...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell It looks like these people come from a very old civilisation.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Trust me, <pc>, I know what I'm talking about. I am from Arboria, after all!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Did you hear the tockles talking about the giant tortoise who protects this village, <pc>?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Tortoises do live for a very long time, so I suppose it does make them a good choice to be guardians.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell Far be it from me to tell these people what to do, but honestly, with this weather and these views they could make a fortune turning the place into a tourist resort!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell I suppose the villagers might not like all the hustle and bustle at first, but I'm sure they'd learn to love it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell Imagine if I'd grown up as the Princess of Heliodor, as I was supposed to. I'd probably still be there now.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell And now we're here visiting other worlds. I guess you just never know how life is going to turn out.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Visiting different worlds is quite the eye-opener, eh, laddie?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I thought I knew a thing or two about the world\emdash and now we find out there's more worlds out there than our own! Aye, it turns out I've still got a lot to learn!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I have no objection to visiting other worlds and coming to their inhabitants' aid.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell But I would urge you not to forget that our own world is also in a desperate state. There remains much for us to do back in Erdrea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I wonder what I'd be like if I'd grown up in a quiet little village like this. I mean, it's not so different from Cobblestone, right? Maybe I'd have turned out just like you, <pc>.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell I don't remember anything about my past, but one thing I'm pretty sure of is that I've always been human. I'm not sure I'd really want to go changing that now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell Ogres, elves, dwarves and...wetlings. Oh, and poppets! I mean, I've never even heard of some of these tribes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell The tockles told me all about these five statues, each of which represents one of those tribes. It's pretty interesting, isn't it?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell One of our tockle friends told me that the smallest statue represents the poppet tribe.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell Now, just between you and me, I think it looks a little bit like Veronica. I mean that in a nice way, of course, but I'm not sure she'd see it like that...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Sylvando\cell It sounds like changing your tribe isn't like changing your hairstyle or changing your job, honey. This kind of transformation is on a whole different level!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell There are seven plinths, but only five statues. I wonder why...? Could there be other tribes in this world that we don't know about yet?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I'm quite fond of the idea of being born again. I reckon I'd make a fine wetling, to be honest. Or a wee elf. Aye, that'd be quite something.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell Back in Tickington, one of the tockles asked me why I had chosen the life of an ogre. I did not have the faintest idea what he was talking about, but now I think I understand...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
