\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Erik\cell But I get the feeling that nothing really surprises you any more. You look like you can take this kind of stuff in your stride.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell What did the tockles say their job was again? To make sure that time flows as it should, and that all is unfolding as intended?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Veronica\cell It's amazing to think they're doing such an important job, and yet no one can see them. It seems a bit of a shame\emdash I mean, they're so adorable!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
