\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Serena\cell I think it's their little bellies I like best. I'd never dare do it, of course, but I'd be so curious to know what it feels like to poke one!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
