\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell Sounds as though these wee tockles have been searching for ye for a while, laddie. They need yer help, by the sounds of it...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Rab\cell I know it can't be easy to be the Luminary and have all these folks relying on ye, but ye mustn't let them down, whatever ye do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl Hendrik\cell I must confess, I have never laid eyes upon such curious creatures before. I find it hard to believe that this is not a dream.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
