\cellx973\cellx10376 
\pard\intbl\qr\cell 
\pard\intbl It's just so nice, travelling around with you. You'll take me to lots more exciting places, won't you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
